      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Spontaneous perforation of the small bowel as a cause of acute abdomen are seldom observed. In our patients 4 cases of non-traumatic perforation are reported. Compared with the international literature the incidence and different pathways of the perforation are discussed."},
